    "enUS": {
      "description": "You are unsure of the significance of the necklace that fell from the neck of the recently-slain wildkin. It glows brightly, slowly fading in and out.\n\nTrull Failbane might be able to tell you more, since his knowledge of the wildkin seems extensive. Perhaps you should ask him about it.",
      "dialogue": {
        "0b26cef286f5492dd15e": "Reporting for another assignment?",
        "7c974082d6b4ce79ab02": "An important discovery?"
      },
      "summary": "Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Trull Failbane at Bloodvenom Post.",
      "title": "Guarding Secrets",
